  - m_Id: 7162906533732387
    m_Localized: An all-rounder turret that works in any situation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7162906533732388
    m_Localized: Lays down a barrage to shoot down fast, small ships.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7162906533732389
    m_Localized: Clears out swarms of enemies with explosive damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7162906533732390
    m_Localized: Close-range DPS for taking down many enemies at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7162906533732391
    m_Localized: Long-range sniper that quickly removes threatening enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7162906533732392
    m_Localized: Projects burst firepower. Made for boss raids.
